# Meridian — project intelligence

This repo is **Meridian** (`peak6_pm`): same-day MAG7 binary Outcome Markets on Solana devnet with OpenBook V2 v1.7.

## Memory Bank

After any reset, read all of `memory-bank/` before acting: `projectbrief.md`, `productContext.md`, `systemPatterns.md`, `techContext.md`, `activeContext.md`, `progress.md`.

## Document authority

1. `CONTEXT.md` owns vocabulary.
2. `docs/adr/0001`–`0028` are accepted Rounds 1–6 decisions.
3. `docs/PRD.md` **v0.7** owns reconciled product behavior and acceptance.
4. `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` **v1.1** owns component/CPI/account design.
5. `docs/REQUIREMENTS.md` is the converted source spec; the original PDF is source of truth if present.

If output would contradict an ADR or the v0.7/v1.1 freeze, say so explicitly instead of silently overriding.

## Current phase

Docs-only working tree. **M0 (G1–G12) is authorized.** Do not start M1 until a signed go/no-go report. Origin `main` may still be the older v0.6 commit until the freeze is committed.

## Non-negotiables

- Solana **devnet** only. No mainnet, no real funds.
- OpenBook V2 v1.7 is the venue. No fork. MIT `cpi`/`client` or MIT IDL/layouts only — never GPL program source. Require `upgrade_authority == None`.
- `create_venue_market` is the only attachable venue path. Order creation only through Meridian PDAs. Never construct supported OpenBook order-creation transactions from the app.
- Limits are PostOnly; Market Actions are full-fill-or-revert. Fail closed rather than persist partial synthetic exposure.
- Collateral vault never pays SOL/rent/EventHeap penalties. Collateral Surplus is non-withdrawable in V1.
- V1 is **protocol-fee-free**. No fee_admin, treasury, claim/taker switches, or collection instructions. OpenBook `collect_fee_admin` is an unsignable sentinel.
- One Settlement Record per ticker and Trading Day. Official Close is Nasdaq NOCP, not a daily bar. Synthetic demo cannot satisfy G11.
- Issues live on GitLab; use `glab`. Canonical triage labels: `needs-triage`, `needs-info`, `ready-for-agent`, `ready-for-human`, `wontfix`.
- Frontend path is `frontend/`, not `app/`.
